            "img": "icons/creatures/abilities/cougar-pounce-stalk-black.webp",
            "system": {
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>At the start of each scene, if the [[lookup @actor.name]]{Actor Name} isn’t <strong>Surprised</strong>, they make a [[test skill=stl]] against the enemy they can sense who has the highest Spiritual defense. On a success, the [[lookup @actor.name]]{Actor Name} can use <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">1</span> before the first round. On a failure, or if they can’t sense any enemies, they can use <strong>Gain Advantag</strong>e as <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">0</span> on their first turn.</p>",
